#. module: coop_parental_leave
#: model:mail.template,body_html:coop_parental_leave.abandoned_parental_leave_email
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>, </p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    You had requested parental leave from the Membership Office.\n"
"                    In order for this leave to be validated, you had 4 weeks to present your child's birth certificate to us.\n"
"                    Unless we are mistaken, we have not seen this document.\n"
"                    Your leave was therefore unsuccessful.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    If you chose to keep your place on your team when you requested leave,\n"
"                    your status now reflects your situation when you applied for the leave.\n"
"                    We are waiting for you at your next service.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    If you were not part of a team or you decided to leave your team when you requested leave,\n"
"                    your status is now \"unsubscribed\".\n"
"                    You are not on a team, so you cannot shop at the store.\n"
"                    To join a team again, you must contact the Membership Office.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Please consult your member area to find out your status.\n"
"                    For any information, contact the members' office during its opening hours:\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <pre>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/>\n"
"                </pre>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>Members' office</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>, </p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Vous aviez fait une demande de congé parental auprès du Bureau des membres.\n"
"                    Pour que ce congé puisse être validé, vous aviez 4 semaines pour nous présenter l'acte de naissance de votre enfant.\n"
"                    Sauf erreur de notre part, nous n'avons pas vu ce document.\n"
"                    Votre congé n'a donc pas abouti.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Si vous aviez choisi de garder votre place dans votre équipe lorsque vous aviez demandé le congé,\n"
"                    votre statut reflète maintenant votre situation lorsque vous avez posé la demande de congés.\n"
"                    Nous vous attendons à votre prochain service.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Si vous ne faisiez pas partie d'une équipe ou bien vous aviez décidé de quitter votre équipe lorsque vous avez demandé le congé,\n"
"                    votre statut est maintenant \"désinscrit\".\n"
"                    Vous n'êtes dans aucune équipe, vous ne pouvez donc pas faire vos courses au magasin.\n"
"                    Pour rejoindre de nouveau une équipe, vous devez contacter le Bureau des membres.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Merci de consulter votre espace membre pour connaître votre statut.\n"
"                    Pour tout renseignement, contactez le Bureau des membres pendant ses horaires d'ouverture :\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <pre>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/>\n"
"                </pre>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>Bureau des membres</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

#. module: coop_parental_leave
#: model:mail.template,body_html:coop_parental_leave.validate_parental_leave_email_after_birthdate
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>, </p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>Your parental leave from <t t-out=\"object.start_date\"/> to <t t-out=\"object.stop_date\"/> has been recorded.</p>\n"
"                <p>As a reminder, during this period, you can do your shopping, and you are exempt from services.</p>\n"
"                <p>At the end of your leave, you will need to contact the Membership Office to join a team, and thus be able to do your shopping.</p>\n"
"                <p>For any information, contact the members' office during its opening hours:</p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <pre>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/>\n"
"                </pre>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <span>Have a good day,</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>Members' office</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>, </p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>Votre congé parental du <t t-out=\"object.start_date\"/> au <t t-out=\"object.stop_date\"/> a été enregistré.</p>\n"
"                <p>Pour rappel, pendant cette période, vous pouvez faire vos courses, et vous êtes exemptés de services.</p>\n"
"                <p>À la fin de votre congé, vous devrez contacter le Bureau des membres pour rejoindre une équipe, et ainsi pouvoir faire vos courses.</p>\n"
"                <p>Pour tout renseignement, contactez le Bureau des membres pendant ses horaires d'ouverture :</p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <pre>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/>\n"
