"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <span>Bonne journée,</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>Bureau des membres</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

#. module: coop_parental_leave
#: model:mail.template,body_html:coop_parental_leave.reminder_birth_certificate_leave_email
msgid ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Hello <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>,</p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    The 4 weeks after your baby's expected date of birth are about to go by and,\n"
"                    Unless we are mistaken, we have not yet seen your child's birth certificate.\n"
"                    Please present it to the Members' office during its opening hours, or send us a scan to\n"
"                    the address bureau.membres@cooplalouve.fr.\n"
"                    La Louve does not keep any copies, we just need to see the certificate.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Deadline for showing the birth certificate:\n"
"                    <span t-if=\"object.expected_birthdate\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"(object.expected_birthdate + datetime.timedelta(days=28)).strftime('%Y-%m-%d')\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Without presentation of the birth certificate within the time limit, your parental leave will be canceled:\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        - If you chose to keep your place on your team when you requested leave,\n"
"                        your status will reflect your situation when you applied for the leave.\n"
"                        We will wait for you at your next service.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        - If you were not part of a team or you decided to leave your team when you requested leave,\n"
"                        your status will change to \"unsubscribed\" and you will not be able to do your shopping at the store.\n"
"                        To join a team again, you must contact the Membership Office.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    For any information, contact the members' office during its opening hours:\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <pre>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/>\n"
"                </pre>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <span>Have a good day,</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>Members' office</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"<div>\n"
"                <p>Bonjour <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.name.split(',')[0]\"/>,</p>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Les 4 semaines suivant la date de naissance prévue de votre bébé sont sur le point de s'écouler et,\n"
"                    sauf erreur de notre part, nous n'avons pas encore vu l'acte de naissance de votre enfant.\n"
"                    Merci de le présenter au Bureau des membres pendant ses horaires d'ouverture, ou de nous envoyer un scan à\n"
"                    l'adresse bureau.membres@cooplalouve.fr.\n"
"                    La Louve ne garde aucune copie, nous avons juste besoin de voir le certificat.\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Date limite pour présenter l'acte de naissance :\n"
"                    <span t-if=\"object.expected_birthdate\">\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"(object.expected_birthdate + datetime.timedelta(days=28)).strftime('%Y-%m-%d')\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Sans présentation de l'acte de naissance dans le délai imparti, votre congé parental sera annulé :\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <div style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        - Si vous aviez choisi de garder votre place dans votre équipe lorsque vous aviez demandé le congé,\n"
"                        votre statut reflétera votre situation lorsque vous avez posé la demande de congés.\n"
"                        Nous vous attendrons à votre prochain service.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                    <p>\n"
"                        - Si vous ne faisiez pas partie d'une équipe ou bien vous aviez décidé de quitter votre équipe lorsque vous avez demandé le congé,\n"
"                        votre statut basculera en \"désinscrit\" et vous ne pourrez pas faire vos courses au magasin.\n"
"                        Pour rejoindre de nouveau une équipe, vous devez contacter le Bureau des membres.\n"
"                    </p>\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <div>\n"
"                    Pour tout renseignement, contactez le Bureau des membres pendant ses horaires d'ouverture :\n"
"                </div>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <pre>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.members_office_open_hours\"/>\n"
"                </pre>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <p>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.phone\"/>\n"
"                </p>\n"
"                <span>Bonne journée,</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>Bureau des membres</span>\n"
"                <br/>\n"
"                <span>\n"
"                    <t t-out=\"object.partner_id.company_id.name\"/>\n"
"                </span>\n"
"            </div>\n"
"        "

